          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Connect · {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Reach {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — integrative, whole-person care that honors your story. Book an intensive intake or ask a question.\\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg-1:#f6fbf9;\\n      --bg-2:#f0f8ff;\\n      --accent:#6b8e78;\\n      --muted:#6c6f72;\\n      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\\n      --card:#ffffff;\\n      --cta:#2f6b5a;\\n      --cta-2:#74b08b;\\n      --radius:14px;\\n      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial;\\n    }\\n    /* Page baseline */\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg-1),var(--bg-2));color:#0b0b0b}\\n    .wrap{min-height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column}\\n\\n    /* Subtle hero band with SVG pattern embedded as data URI */\\n    .hero{\\n      position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:48px 20px 36px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;align-items:center;gap:20px;\\n    }\\n    .hero::before{\\n      content:\\\"\\\";position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0.12;background-image: url(\\\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='600' height='400' viewBox='0 0 600 400'%3E%3Cdefs%3E%3Cpattern id='p' x='0' y='0' width='80' height='80' patternUnits='userSpaceOnUse'%3E%3Crect width='80' height='80' fill='%23f6fbf9'/%3E%3Ccircle cx='10' cy='10' r='2' fill='%236b8e78'/%3E%3Ccircle cx='70' cy='70' r='2' fill='%236b8e78'/%3E%3Cline x1='0' y1='80' x2='80' y2='0' stroke='%2374b08b' stroke-width='0.6' opacity='0.5'/%3E%3C/pattern%3E%3C/defs%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' fill='url(%23p)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E\\\");background-size:cover;pointer-events:none;mix-blend-mode:multiply}\\n\\n    .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;justify-content:space-between;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 18px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .brand .logo{width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--cta),var(--cta-2));display:grid;place-items:center;color:white;font-weight:700;font-size:18px}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n    nav a.primary{color:var(--cta);background:transparent;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px}\\n\\n    .container{max-width:1100px;margin:18px auto;padding:24px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px}\\n    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:calc(var(--radius));padding:22px;box-shadow:0 6px 22px rgba(12,18,15,0.06);}\\n\\n    h1{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:28px;color:#083229}\\n    p.lead{margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}\\n\\n    /* Form */\\n    form{display:grid;gap:12px}\\n    label{font-size:13px;color:#34473a;margin-bottom:6px;display:block}\\n    input[type=text], input[type=email], textarea, select{width:100%;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(11,11,11,0.06);font-size:14px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.95), rgba(250,250,250,0.95));box-sizing:border-box}\\n    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}\\n    .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}\\n    .btn{display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--cta),var(--cta-2));color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:12px;border:0;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}\\n    .btn.secondary{background:transparent;color:var(--cta);border:2px solid rgba(47,107,90,0.12)}\\n\\n    /* Side info */\\n    .info{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    .meta{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .meta svg{width:18px;height:18px;opacity:0.9}\\n    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    /* Map / visual */\\n    .map{height:220px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(117,154,131,0.12), rgba(117,154,131,0.04));display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    /* FAQ and schedule */\\n    .faq{display:grid;gap:10px}\\n    .qa{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.9),rgba(255,255,255,0.98));border:1px solid rgba(11,11,11,0.04)}\\n    .muted-block{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n\\n    footer{margin-top:auto;padding:22px 18px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n\\n    @media (max-width:920px){.container{grid-template-columns:1fr}.nav{padding:0 12px}.brand .logo{width:46px;height:46px}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"nav\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"logo\\\">HM</div>\\n          <div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <nav>\\n          <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Welcome</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Offerings</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"conditions.html\\\">Concerns</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Philosophy</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Invest</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Our Story</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"book.html\\\" class=\\\"primary\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Connect</a>\\n        </nav>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div style=\\\"max-width:1100px;margin:10px auto;padding:0 18px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <h1>Connect with {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} — thoughtful, whole-person care</h1>\\n            <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Prefer friendly rigor over quick fixes. We focus on education, detailed intake, and an individualized plan. Use this page to ask a question, request an intensive intake, or find practice details.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"text-align:right;min-width:220px\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Call or text</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:800;font-size:18px\\\">{{PHONE}}</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\"><a href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" class=\\\"btn\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main class=\\\"container\\\">\\n      <section class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h2 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Send a quick note</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted-block\\\">Have a question about sessions, suitability, or the intake process? Send a short note — we aim to respond within 2 business days. For booking, use the primary button above.</p>\\n\\n        <form action=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" enctype=\\\"text/plain\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <label for=\\\"name\\\">Your name</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"First &amp; last\\\" />\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Optional\\\" />\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@domain.com\\\" />\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"reason\\\">Reason for reaching out</label>\\n          <select id=\\\"reason\\\" name=\\\"reason\\\">\\n            <option>General question</option>\\n            <option>Request an intensive intake</option>\\n            <option>Follow-up about a plan</option>\\n            <option>Lab inquiry / testing</option>\\n            <option>Other</option>\\n          </select>\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"message\\\">Message</label>\\n          <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Tell us a bit about what brings you in. No medical advice here — just an introduction.\\\"></textarea>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:6px\\\">\\n            <button type=\\\"submit\\\" class=\\\"btn\\\">Send message</button>\\n            <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" class=\\\"btn secondary\\\">Call {{PHONE}}</a>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">By contacting us you agree to a brief review of your message. Messages are not a substitute for urgent care. For emergencies, call local emergency services or go to the nearest ER.</p>\\n        </form>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"info\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Location</div>\\n              <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"small\\\">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div style=\\\"text-align:right\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"small\\\">Practitioner</div>\\n              <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <hr style=\\\"border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(11,11,11,0.04);margin:12px 0\\\" />\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"meta\\\">\\n            <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><path d=\\\"M12 2v6\\\" stroke=\\\"#6b8e78\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\"/><path d=\\\"M5 10h14\\\" stroke=\\\"#6b8e78\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\"/><path d=\\\"M6 20h12\\\" stroke=\\\"#6b8e78\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\"/></svg>\\n            <div>\\n              <div class=\\\"small\\\">Hours</div>\\n              <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Mon — Thu · 9:00 — 18:00</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"small\\\">Fri · 9:00 — 14:00 · Sat by request</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\" class=\\\"meta\\\">\\n            <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><path d=\\\"M21 8v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-3\\\" stroke=\\\"#6b8e78\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\"/><path d=\\\"M3 6v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h3\\\" stroke=\\\"#6b8e78\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\"/></svg>\\n            <div>\\n              <div class=\\\"small\\\">Contact</div>\\n              <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{PHONE}}</div>\\n              <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);\\\">Email: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\" class=\\\"small\\\">Intensive intakes available: multi-stage visits that prioritize detailed history, movement, breath, and optional educational labs. No guaranteed cures — education and shared decision-making are core to our approach.</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Visit snapshot</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">What to expect at an initial intensive intake:</div>\\n          <ul style=\\\"margin:10px 0 0;padding-left:18px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n            <li>Comprehensive history & lifestyle review</li>\\n            <li>Collaborative goals and education</li>\\n            <li>Movement, breath, and functional assessment</li>\\n            <li>Plan with follow-up cadence, and optional labs for education</li>\\n          </ul>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><a href=\\\"book.html\\\" class=\\\"btn\\\">Reserve an intake</a></div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 6px\\\">Location preview</h4>\\n          <div class=\\\"map\\\">Map placeholder — in production this will be an embedded map or a static SVG of the neighborhood.</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 6px\\\">Quick FAQ</h4>\\n          <div class=\\\"faq\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"qa\\\"><strong>Do you accept insurance?</strong>\\n              <div class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\">We provide superbills and can discuss which services may be eligible. Insurance coverage varies; we can talk options during intake.</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"qa\\\"><strong>Is this a cure?</strong>\\n              <div class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\">No single approach guarantees outcomes. We emphasize education, measurable steps, and adjustments based on your response.</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"qa\\\"><strong>Can I request labs?</strong>\\n              <div class=\\\"small\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\">Yes — optional, evidence-informed labs can be discussed as educational tools to guide plans.</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div style=\\\"max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:12px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px\\\">\\n          <div>&copy; <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong> · {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\\\">\\n            <a href=\\\"privacy.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">Privacy</a>\\n            <a href=\\\"terms.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">Terms</a>\\n            <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"Chunk 4 — contact page and usage notes\\n\\nThis chunk provides two files:\\n\\n- contact.html — A responsive, zen-minimal contact page for the holistic/integrative medicine site.\\n- README.md — This file (usage notes).\\n\\nDesign intent and features:\\n- Layout family: zen_minimal (clean spacing, soft radii, calm gradients).\\n- Voice: playful_premium — measured, warm, lightly playful language suitable for premium holistic care.\\n- Offer model: intensive — emphasizes multi-stage intakes and education-focused visits.\\n- Visual richness: CSS gradients + an embedded SVG pattern via data URI (no external assets or CDNs).\\n- Contact page includes: contact form (mailto: fallback), practitioner & practice details, hours, short FAQ, a map placeholder, and an obvious primary CTA linking to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}.\\n\\nPlaceholders to replace during build or runtime:\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n- {{TAGLINE}}\\n- {{PHONE}}\\n- {{EMAIL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\n- {{CITY}}\\n- {{STATE}}\\n- {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}\\n- {{CREDENTIALS}}\\n\\nAccessibility & disclaimers:\\n- The page explicitly avoids claims of cures and stresses education, shared decision-making, and that messages are not a substitute for emergency care.\\n- Form uses mailto: content for simple static deployments. For production, swap the form action for a server endpoint or form service.\\n\\nNotes for integrators:\\n- Navigation labels intentionally vary from other templates (e.g., \\\"Welcome\\\", \\\"Offerings\\\", \\\"Concerns\\\", \\\"Philosophy\\\", \\\"Invest\\\", \\\"Our Story\\\", \\\"Reserve\\\", \\\"Connect\\\") — keep links pointing to the canonical files (index.html, services.html, conditions.html, approach.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html, contact.html).\\n- The page references no external fonts; it uses system fonts for performance and consistency.\\n- If you want a standalone assets SVG (assets/img/pattern.svg), you may extract the small pattern encoded in the CSS background of the hero and create that file for reuse, but the contact page is intentionally self-contained.\\n\\nStyling and structure are intentionally simple so the rest of the site (index, services, etc.) can adopt the same visual system while offering unique copy and section orders.\\n\\nEnd of chunk 4.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
